- Make a one-page timeline of key dates and events.
- Make contact lists for all potential witnesses and note what each would testify to.
- Flag any documents that need certified copies or translations.
- Draft short witness declarations (one paragraph per key fact) and send to witnesses for signature (run by Amy first).
- Prepare a short email to Amy (template below) to save time.

