- Which case(s) are active and what is the next hearing date/type?
- Discovery status: I understand discovery just ended — do we still need anything else?
- Attached is what I’ve already gathered (list attachments or say “I’ll attach list”). Please tell me the single most important items I should still acquire and whether you want me to:
  - prepare witness declarations,
  - subpoena third-party records, or
  - arrange any expert inspections.
Also: are there any filing or exhibit deadlines coming up in Maricopa County or before immigration court we should hit? Thanks — I can call or meet if that’s easier.

If you want, I can help you convert your documents into that indexed folder/timeline or draft the witness declarations for you to review and send to Amy.

Finally, if you tell me which matter is the highest priority (eviction, immigration, or custody) and the next hearing date, I’ll tailor a prioritized, case-specific evidence list and an action timeline you can follow.

