- Request certified records now (criminal records, school, medical) since obtaining certifications can take weeks.  
- Identify any records you may need to subpoena and discuss cost/timeline with Amy.  
- Prepare a 1-page timeline and a list of the five strongest pieces of evidence to share with Amy.

