- Any missing discovery that could be critical (financial records, police/CPS records).
- Evidence that needs immediate preservation (phones, computers, property).
- Opposing party’s likely witnesses or documents you haven’t seen.
- Any deadlines to disclose expert witnesses or expert reports.

