Key issues to confirm with your attorney (short version you can copy/paste)
- Which court has jurisdiction for the next hearing and what is the scheduled/expected date?
- What is the exact legal issue(s) we must prove at the hearing and what standard of proof applies?
- From the discovery results, do you consider the record complete or should we obtain additional documents or witness statements?
- Which documents/evidence do you recommend we add before the hearing (and why)?
