General (applies to most hearings)
- Chronology/timeline of key events with dates and short notes
- Copies of all correspondence (emails, texts, social media DMs) relevant to the dispute
- Photos and videos (with dates/timestamps if possible) and a short description of what each shows
- Contact info for all potential witnesses and brief summary of what each can say
- Receipts, bank statements, canceled checks showing payments or transfers
- Police reports, incident reports, emergency/911 calls
- Medical records or school reports (if child welfare is an issue)
- Any prior court orders, judgments, or agency decisions

If this is an eviction/landlord-tenant matter (Maricopa County specifics)
