- Notices served (Notice to Pay or Quit, Notice to Cure, Notice to Vacate) with proof of service
- Rent ledgers, payment records, receipts, bank transfers showing rent history
- Photographs/videos of property condition (move-in and current)
- Repair requests, emails/maintenance logs, work orders and invoices
- Building/health code violation citations, city inspection reports
- Security deposit records (amount, receipts, disposition)
- Correspondence with property manager or landlord
- Move-in/move-out inspection checklist if available

If this involves custody/family matters (other parent as opposing party)
- Court orders, parenting plans, custody history
- Child’s school records, attendance, teacher statements
- Medical records related to child's safety/wellbeing
- Texts/emails about parenting disagreements or dangerous incidents
- Witness statements about parenting, living conditions, or visitation problems
- Any CPS/investigative reports (if applicable)

