- Immigration records (I-94, removal/notice to appear, previous filings)
- Legal status documentation, passports, travel docs
- Evidence of presence/residence, employment, family ties, and hardship
- Certified translations for any foreign-language docs
- Any prior immigration decisions or case-related filings

