Questions to ask Amy (use these as a short checklist in a meeting or email)
1. Case status & deadlines
   - What is the current procedural posture (discovery closed — any outstanding motions or requests still pending)?
   - Do we have a scheduled hearing date? If not, when is one expected and are there deadlines we must meet before then?
   - Are there any local Maricopa County rules or form requirements I should know about for the next hearing?

2. Evidence & gaps
   - Based on what you’ve seen so far, what specific types of evidence do you think are still needed to prove our claims/defenses?
   - Are there any documents I should get certified or otherwise authenticated (e.g., lease, certified mail receipts, official records)?
   - Do we need more contemporaneous records (bank statements, rent ledger, repair receipts, text message logs)?

3. Witnesses & affidavits
   - Which witnesses should we plan to call or have affidavits from? Are written affidavits sufficient or will they need to testify live?
