   - Any concerns about hearsay, authentication, or foundation for the documents I already have?
   - Should we have documents translated and certified if any are in another language?
   - Do you expect any expert testimony will be necessary (property condition expert, accountant, etc.)?

5. Discovery and third-party evidence
   - Is there any follow-up discovery we should pursue (subpoenas to banks, utility companies, employers, phone companies, social media, repair companies)?
   - Were there any discovery responses from the opposing party that we should challenge or follow up on?

6. Strategy & likely issues at hearing
   - What legal issues do you expect the judge to focus on at the hearing?
   - What are the strengths and weaknesses of our position and what evidence would most strengthen it?

7. Logistics & coordination with other cases
   - Does this eviction/court matter interact with the immigration or custody case in ways I should prepare for?
   - Should we coordinate evidence and witnesses across cases? Do we need a confidentiality/protective order for sensitive documents?

