- Number documents and create an index (Document 1: Lease; Doc 2: Rent ledger; Doc 3: Notice dated mm/dd/yyyy).
- Keep originals safe and provide Amy with clean copies (PDF preferred). If files are large, use a secure file-share link and note any documents that must be returned.
- Flag any documents you did not obtain directly (third-party records) so Amy can advise on subpoenas.

