- Or I can help you build the exhibit index or a timeline document from what you already have — tell me what documents you’ve collected and I’ll propose a structure.

Finally — a quick caution
I’m not providing legal advice; use these as organizational and preparation suggestions. Your attorney Amy Foster is the right person to confirm what is required under the specific court rules and your case strategy.

