Would you like me to:
- draft that email to Amy Foster now (I can populate details and keep it concise), or
- produce a printable exhibit checklist and a one-page timeline template you can fill out?

Also please tell me whether we should focus on eviction, immigration, or custody first (or all together), plus any immediate deadlines you already know. That will let me tailor next steps precisely.

