4) If any documents need certification, translation, or notarization before the hearing?
5) Any other action items you recommend I complete by [insert date, e.g., two weeks before hearing]? 

I can begin assembling the documents you list and prepare exhibit binders. Thanks — I want to be fully prepared.  

(If you want, I can draft this into an email for you to send.)

